    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d495">

                <pb facs="1020" n="980" sameAs="frus:frus1955-57v16/pg980"/>

                <head>495. Message From Prime Minister Eden to President Eisenhower<anchor n="1" xml:id="d495-f1"/></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1956-11-04"><hi rendition="#italic">November 4,
                        1956</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Friend</hi>: I am sending you a personal message
                    to explain why, although we welcome the request to the Secretary-General
                    contained in the Canadian resolution, we find it impossible to accept the
                    Afro-Asian resolution. I send you this preliminary notice remembering the last
                    occasion, when owing to cyphering delays my message failed to reach you before
                    our announcement was made.<anchor n="2" xml:id="d495-f2"/></p>
                <p>Yours ever,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#bold"
                            >Anthony</hi><anchor n="3" xml:id="d495-f3"
                    /></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d495-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d495-f1-content">
                <p>Source: Eisenhower Library, Whitman File, International File. Secret.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d495-f2" n="2" xml:id="d495-f2-content">
                <p>Reference is presumably to Eden’s
                    message to Eisenhower of October 30, <ref
                        target="#d421">Document 421</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d495-f3" n="3" xml:id="d495-f3-content">
                <p>Printed from a copy that bears this typed signature.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
